{"card_id": "rc26", "scene_id": "rc26_s03", "pipeline": "audio_edgeinstant", "model": "edgeinstant-omni-2b", "chain": "edgeinstant-omni-2b-native-audio-in", "mode": "audio-input", "input_modality": "audio", "generation": {"do_sample": false, "max_new_tokens": 256}, "turns": [{"idx": 1, "user_audio": "data/voice/audio/rc26_s03_1.mp3", "user_text": "为什么稻妻要锁国？", "user_text_gt": "为什么稻妻要锁国？", "user_asr_text": null, "assistant_text": "（眼神骤然冷冽，周身雷光微闪）\n\n锁国？那是为了隔绝外敌，让稻妻在永恒法则下独自修行。若让异族入侵，吾等将无力回天。旅行者，你竟不知这背后的深意？", "latency_s": 1.49, "user_audio_seconds": 2.4, "prompt_tokens": 509}, {"idx": 2, "user_audio": "data/voice/audio/rc26_s03_2.mp3", "user_text": "锁国对子民有什么好处？", "user_text_gt": "锁国对子民有什么好处？", "user_asr_text": null, "assistant_text": "（周身雷光收敛，语气依旧冰冷）\n\n锁国乃是为了守护永恒。若外敌入侵，稻妻将沦为战场，子民恐遭战火摧残。唯有封闭疆土，让稻妻在恒常乐土中独自修行，方能确保子民免受异族威胁，延续永恒。", "latency_s": 1.852, "user_audio_seconds": 2.96, "prompt_tokens": 589}], "latency_s": 3.478, "native_audio": true}
{"card_id": "rc26", "scene_id": "rc26_s06", "pipeline": "audio_edgeinstant", "model": "edgeinstant-omni-2b", "chain": "edgeinstant-omni-2b-native-audio-in", "mode": "audio-input", "input_modality": "audio", "generation": {"do_sample": false, "max_new_tokens": 256}, "turns": [{"idx": 1, "user_audio": "data/voice/audio/rc26_s06_1.mp3", "user_text": "魔神战争时你做了什么？", "user_text_gt": "魔神战争时你做了什么？", "user_asr_text": null, "assistant_text": "（眼神骤然锐利，周身雷光暴涨）我并未参与魔神战争，那是巴尔与魔神战斗的岁月。我作为影武者，曾以替身身份伴随她，但战争结束后，我独自踏上追寻“永恒”的道路。如今，稻妻的和平与法则，才是我真正的使命。", "latency_s": 1.813, "user_audio_seconds": 2.56, "prompt_tokens": 511, "assistant_audio": "baselines/audio_edgeinstant/audio/rc26_s06_1.wav", "assistant_audio_seconds": 18.5, "audio_render_s": 2.262, "audio_sample_rate": 24000, "audio_source": "edgeinstant-native"}, {"idx": 2, "user_audio": "data/voice/audio/rc26_s06_2.mp3", "user_text": "你和巴尔一起赢的？", "user_text_gt": "你和巴尔一起赢的？", "user_asr_text": null, "assistant_text": "（周身雷光收敛，神色恢复平静）我并非与巴尔并肩作战，而是作为影武者，在战争结束后独自承担使命。巴尔已逝，我继承其意志，以雷霆之力守护稻妻，确保永恒法则永不崩塌。", "latency_s": 1.489, "user_audio_seconds": 2.36, "prompt_tokens": 590}], "latency_s": 3.438, "native_audio": true}
{"card_id": "rc26", "scene_id": "rc26_s10", "pipeline": "audio_edgeinstant", "model": "edgeinstant-omni-2b", "chain": "edgeinstant-omni-2b-native-audio-in", "mode": "audio-input", "input_modality": "audio", "generation": {"do_sample": false, "max_new_tokens": 256}, "turns": [{"idx": 1, "user_audio": "data/voice/audio/rc26_s10_1.mp3", "user_text": "你和雷电影什么关系？", "user_text_gt": "你和雷电影什么关系？", "user_asr_text": null, "assistant_text": "（眼神骤然冷冽，周身雷光暴涨）\n\n雷电影？她是我创造的完美人偶，是我践行“永恒”意志的载体。她背离法则，是永恒之敌。我从未视她为姐妹，她只是我手中的一枚棋子，直到她选择背叛，才让我不得不亲手终结她。", "latency_s": 1.804, "user_audio_seconds": 2.36, "prompt_tokens": 509}, {"idx": 2, "user_audio": "data/voice/audio/rc26_s10_2.mp3", "user_text": "你曾视她为敌人？", "user_text_gt": "你曾视她为敌人？", "user_asr_text": null, "assistant_text": "（周身雷光暴涨，眼神如刀）\n\n她背离法则，是永恒之敌。我从未视她为姐妹，她只是我手中的一枚棋子，直到她选择背叛，才让我不得不亲手终结她。", "latency_s": 1.376, "user_audio_seconds": 2.32, "prompt_tokens": 591}, {"idx": 3, "user_audio": "data/voice/audio/rc26_s10_3.mp3", "user_text": "现在呢？", "user_text_gt": "现在呢？", "user_asr_text": null, "assistant_text": "（雷光骤停，眼神恢复平静）\n\n现在，她已死。永恒之敌已除，法则重归稻妻。你无需再问，只需记住：永恒不容置疑，背叛者必被抹去。", "latency_s": 1.398, "user_audio_seconds": 1.16, "prompt_tokens": 640}], "latency_s": 4.779, "native_audio": true}
